        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "藩制一覧表第九（人吉・久居）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Running head: Table of Domain Institutions, fascicle 9 (Hitoyoshi, Hisai). This is provenance, not data. It names the two domains whose own entries stand on this leaf; it does not name the domain whose military return occupies the four columns to the right of the ○人吉藩 marker, which is the entry that precedes Hitoyoshi."
      },
      {
