      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troops. The section heading that opens the military return in the rightmost data column. It stands to the right of the ○人吉藩 marker and therefore belongs to the preceding domain's entry, which the project's MASTER extraction identifies as Hirado. No figure is printed with the heading itself."
